    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Felisade is a <strong>strategic digital card game</strong> with 250 cards where each card represents an <strong>anthropomorphic cats</strong>. Build your deck, master powerful abilities, and challenge opponents in <strong>tactical duels</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play rare magic to dominate the board.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck trainer to easily test new builds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb4 Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect &amp; Battle</strong> \u2013 Assemble a deck of <strong>legendary cat heroes</strong> with unique abilities.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Anthropomorphic Cats</strong> \u2013 Every card embodies a real-world historical or cultural icon\u2014re-imagined as a cat!<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>resource management, attack power, and health</strong> to outsmart your opponents.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Duels</strong> \u2013 Engage in <strong>fast-paced tactical battles</strong>, where every move matters.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Modifiers &amp; Abilities</strong> \u2013 Cast spells, use buffs, and unleash special effects to dominate the battlefield.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Challenge AI or test your skills against real players in <strong>PvP battles</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-Painted Artwork</strong> \u2013 Stunning card designs bring the feline champions to life.<br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Accessible gameplay with <strong>deep deck-building mechanics</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Become the Ultimate Cat Commander!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a <strong>casual player</strong> or a <strong>hardcore strategist</strong>, <i>Cats of the Arcane</i> offers an immersive experience with endless replayability. Will you craft the <strong>purr-fect deck</strong> and claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your <strong>wishlist now</strong> and prepare for the <strong>ultimate feline duel!</strong> \ud83d\udc08\u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Felisade is a <strong>strategic digital card game</strong> with 250 cards where each card represents an <strong>anthropomorphic cats</strong>. Build your deck, master powerful abilities, and challenge opponents in <strong>tactical duels</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The cards</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/4eb9d42be7b035f053224e19e2fa41c5.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Play rare magic to dominate the board.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/837ff2030509509e4c2682edd573e117.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck trainer to easily test new builds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.poster.avif?t=1748540064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.webm?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523490/extras/8a10717ec58d78640588f72622898d1c.mp4?t=1748540064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb4 Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Collect &amp; Battle</strong> \u2013 Assemble a deck of <strong>legendary cat heroes</strong> with unique abilities.<br>\ud83c\udfad <strong>Anthropomorphic Cats</strong> \u2013 Every card embodies a real-world historical or cultural icon\u2014re-imagined as a cat!<br>\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>resource management, attack power, and health</strong> to outsmart your opponents.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Duels</strong> \u2013 Engage in <strong>fast-paced tactical battles</strong>, where every move matters.<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Global Modifiers &amp; Abilities</strong> \u2013 Cast spells, use buffs, and unleash special effects to dominate the battlefield.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Challenge AI or test your skills against real players in <strong>PvP battles</strong>.<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Hand-Painted Artwork</strong> \u2013 Stunning card designs bring the feline champions to life.<br>\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> \u2013 Accessible gameplay with <strong>deep deck-building mechanics</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Become the Ultimate Cat Commander!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a <strong>casual player</strong> or a <strong>hardcore strategist</strong>, <i>Cats of the Arcane</i> offers an immersive experience with endless replayability. Will you craft the <strong>purr-fect deck</strong> and claim victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your <strong>wishlist now</strong> and prepare for the <strong>ultimate feline duel!</strong> \ud83d\udc08\u2728</p>",
